                <pb facs="0873" n="774" xml:id="pg774"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">812.404/1862: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Mexico</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Daniels</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-03-28T12:00:00-05:00">March 28, 1936—noon</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>56. Report briefly and promptly by telegraph and in detail by airmail all
                    developments tending to indicate relaxation in religious situation.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
